-- Deepholm, the Maelstrom and the Deepholm gunship: spawns that the base data lacks. The base data has the 4.3.4 spawns of Deepholm
-- (map 646); the 5.4.8 data has 141 creatures (Pebble, Ruberick, Ricket and the credit NPCs of "Sealing the Way", the Deepholm
-- Earthen Ring and the war constructs among them) and 31 objects more, the Maelstrom (map 730) with Thrall and Aggra, whose
-- spawns "The Maelstrom" and "Deepholm, Realm of Earth" need, and the crew of the crashed gunship (transport map 747, the
-- creature rows are deck offsets as for the Icecrown gunships). Entries the world already spawns on map 646 are not touched.
-- Left out on purpose: holiday spawns, the world bosses Terborus, Xariona and Aeonaxx (no boss script here), Millhouse
-- Manastorm and the scenario Thrall 53736.
-- New guids: creatures 9270000 to 9279999 (646: 9270000-9276999, 730: 9277000-9277499, 747: 9277500-9277999), objects
-- 1064000 to 1064999 (646: 1064000-1064499, 730: 1064500-1064599, 747: 1064600-1064699, portals 1064700-1064799), pools 314000
-- to 314099. Safe to run twice (every block deletes its own range first). Based on Legends of Azeroth 5.4.8.

-- Deepholm (map 646)
